# Property-test snapshots are non-deterministic (random inputs each run), so they
# churn on every run and should not be committed. The suites themselves use
# `non_snapshot_env()` and do not write these files; the patterns keep stale
# local snapshots from an older checkout out of version control.
contracts/accord/test_snapshots/test/approval_count_never_exceeds_owner_count.*.json
contracts/accord/test_snapshots/test/approval_weight_always_equals_sum_of_approved_weights.*.json
contracts/accord/test_snapshots/test/active_count_never_exceeds_max.*.json
contracts/accord/test_snapshots/test/total_weight_matches_all_current_owner_weights.*.json
contracts/accord/test_snapshots/test/role_members_index_matches_per_address_roles.*.json

